message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below and keep the MIT licence notice with any copied code."
title: "Qwark's Awakening"
type: software
authors:
  - alias: undecuple
repository-code: "https://github.com/undecuple/qwarks-awakening"
url: "https://github.com/undecuple/qwarks-awakening"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Ratchet & Clank // Unofficial PC Port (static recompilation). A native Windows port of the PS3 Ratchet & Clank games by static recompilation of their PPU and SPU code on ps3recomp, with the PS3 system software they call reimplemented and graphics on Direct3D 12. Early work: the first game, Tools of Destruction, reaches its title menu and plays the opening cutscene; it is not playable yet. Contains no game code or data.
keywords:
  - static recompilation
  - PS3
  - ps3recomp
  - Ratchet & Clank
  - game preservation
